  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A body is projected from the ground at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with the horizontal. Its velocity after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The maximum height reached by the body during its motion is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>. (use <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "20",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1414da65-6742-497c-9ed0-f67bf63695bf-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 106px;\" /></p><p>After&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>&nbsp;the velocity is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>u</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now the maximum height of the projectile is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1600</mn><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
